---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
const lastUpdated = "23 May 2026";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Cybersecurity and Data Breach Policy"
  description="Security controls, breach response, and incident communication for ashmo.io."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Legal"
    title="Cybersecurity"
    highlight="& Breach Policy."
    description={`Security controls and breach response. Last updated: ${lastUpdated}.`}
    primary={{ href: '/privacy-policy/', label: 'Privacy policy' }}
    secondary={{ href: 'mailto:hello@ashmo.io?subject=Security%20concern', label: 'Report a concern' }}
    stats={[
      { value: 'HTTPS', label: 'baseline' },
      { value: '2FA', label: 'admin' },
      { value: '72h', label: 'notify' },
    ]}
    sideEyebrow="Incident response"
    sideTitle="Reasonable controls. Honest about limits. Fast when something is wrong."
    sideDescription="Covers technical controls, detection, containment, notification, recovery, and how to report a security or privacy concern."
  />

  <section class="section-shell pb-24 md:pb-32">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[860px] space-y-4">
      

        <article class="card-base gradient-border p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <p class="mono-label">01 · Security Controls</p>
          <h2 class="mt-4 font-heading text-[1.55rem] md:text-[1.8rem] font-bold leading-[1.15] text-text">Security Controls</h2>
          <div class="mt-5 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.78] text-text-secondary space-y-3 [&_a]:text-accent [&_a:hover]:underline [&_strong]:text-text [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:pl-6 [&_ol]:space-y-2 [&_blockquote]:border-l-2 [&_blockquote]:border-accent/40 [&_blockquote]:pl-4 [&_blockquote]:italic">
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
            <li>HTTPS / TLS across the entire site.</li>
            <li>Restricted access to administrative tools; least-privilege principle.</li>
            <li>Strong password discipline and password manager use.</li>
            <li>Two-factor authentication where supported.</li>
            <li>Encryption in transit; encryption at rest where the underlying service supports it.</li>
            <li>Vendor due diligence on third-party processors.</li>
            <li>Periodic review of access, logs, and configuration.</li>
          </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

        <article class="card-base gradient-border p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <p class="mono-label">02 · No Absolute Guarantee</p>
          <h2 class="mt-4 font-heading text-[1.55rem] md:text-[1.8rem] font-bold leading-[1.15] text-text">No Absolute Guarantee</h2>
          <div class="mt-5 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.78] text-text-secondary space-y-3 [&_a]:text-accent [&_a:hover]:underline [&_strong]:text-text [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:pl-6 [&_ol]:space-y-2 [&_blockquote]:border-l-2 [&_blockquote]:border-accent/40 [&_blockquote]:pl-4 [&_blockquote]:italic">
            <p>No digital system is 100% secure. Despite reasonable controls, no platform can guarantee that data is fully immune to compromise. By using the site you accept this inherent risk.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

        <article class="card-base gradient-border p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <p class="mono-label">03 · Incident Response</p>
          <h2 class="mt-4 font-heading text-[1.55rem] md:text-[1.8rem] font-bold leading-[1.15] text-text">Incident Response</h2>
          <div class="mt-5 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.78] text-text-secondary space-y-3 [&_a]:text-accent [&_a:hover]:underline [&_strong]:text-text [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:pl-6 [&_ol]:space-y-2 [&_blockquote]:border-l-2 [&_blockquote]:border-accent/40 [&_blockquote]:pl-4 [&_blockquote]:italic">
            <p class="mb-3">If a suspected security incident occurs, the following steps are followed:</p>
          <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 space-y-2">
            <li><strong>Detect</strong> — identify the anomaly via logs, monitoring, or user report.</li>
            <li><strong>Contain</strong> — restrict access, rotate credentials, isolate affected systems.</li>
            <li><strong>Assess</strong> — determine scope, data categories affected, likely cause.</li>
            <li><strong>Notify</strong> — inform affected users and, where required by law, regulators.</li>
            <li><strong>Recover</strong> — restore systems, validate integrity, monitor for recurrence.</li>
            <li><strong>Document</strong> — record the incident and the corrective actions.</li>
          </ol>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

        <article class="card-base gradient-border p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <p class="mono-label">04 · Breach Notification</p>
          <h2 class="mt-4 font-heading text-[1.55rem] md:text-[1.8rem] font-bold leading-[1.15] text-text">Breach Notification</h2>
          <div class="mt-5 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.78] text-text-secondary space-y-3 [&_a]:text-accent [&_a:hover]:underline [&_strong]:text-text [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:pl-6 [&_ol]:space-y-2 [&_blockquote]:border-l-2 [&_blockquote]:border-accent/40 [&_blockquote]:pl-4 [&_blockquote]:italic">
            <p>If a personal data breach is likely to result in a risk to your rights, we will notify the relevant supervisory authority and affected users without undue delay, consistent with UAE Federal Decree-Law No. 45 of 2021 (Personal Data Protection Law). Where the law specifies a timeframe, we aim to meet or beat it.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

        <article class="card-base gradient-border p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <p class="mono-label">05 · User Responsibility</p>
          <h2 class="mt-4 font-heading text-[1.55rem] md:text-[1.8rem] font-bold leading-[1.15] text-text">User Responsibility</h2>
          <div class="mt-5 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.78] text-text-secondary space-y-3 [&_a]:text-accent [&_a:hover]:underline [&_strong]:text-text [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:pl-6 [&_ol]:space-y-2 [&_blockquote]:border-l-2 [&_blockquote]:border-accent/40 [&_blockquote]:pl-4 [&_blockquote]:italic">
            <p>Users are responsible for protecting their own credentials, devices, and email accounts. We will never ask for your password. We will never ask you to install unsolicited software. Treat any such request as suspicious and report it.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

        <article class="card-base gradient-border p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <p class="mono-label">06 · Limitation of Liability</p>
          <h2 class="mt-4 font-heading text-[1.55rem] md:text-[1.8rem] font-bold leading-[1.15] text-text">Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <div class="mt-5 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.78] text-text-secondary space-y-3 [&_a]:text-accent [&_a:hover]:underline [&_strong]:text-text [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:pl-6 [&_ol]:space-y-2 [&_blockquote]:border-l-2 [&_blockquote]:border-accent/40 [&_blockquote]:pl-4 [&_blockquote]:italic">
            <p>To the extent permitted by UAE law, ashmo.io is not liable for losses caused by events beyond reasonable control, including DDoS attacks, hosting provider outages, third-party processor breaches, supply-chain compromises, and zero-day exploits, where reasonable security controls were in place.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

        <article class="card-base gradient-border p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <p class="mono-label">07 · Report a Security or Privacy Concern</p>
          <h2 class="mt-4 font-heading text-[1.55rem] md:text-[1.8rem] font-bold leading-[1.15] text-text">Report a Security or Privacy Concern</h2>
          <div class="mt-5 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.78] text-text-secondary space-y-3 [&_a]:text-accent [&_a:hover]:underline [&_strong]:text-text [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:pl-6 [&_ol]:space-y-2 [&_blockquote]:border-l-2 [&_blockquote]:border-accent/40 [&_blockquote]:pl-4 [&_blockquote]:italic">
            <p>If you believe you have found a vulnerability, or have a security or privacy concern, email <a href="mailto:hello@ashmo.io?subject=Security%20concern" class="text-accent hover:underline">hello@ashmo.io</a> with the subject line "Security concern". We respond as quickly as possible and treat reports confidentially.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
